# SyncSenta — Implementation Reference (Index)

This file is a pointer document. The full implementation knowledge is split into
focused steering files under `.kiro/steering/` that agents load on demand.

**Read `CONTEXT.md` first** for the domain glossary.

---

## Steering files (load the one relevant to your task)

| File | Load when working on... |
|---|---|
| `.kiro/steering/project-overview.md` | Project structure, stack, monorepo layout, demo accounts, git state |
| `.kiro/steering/omega-engine.md` | Omega tutoring engine, scaffolding, answer quality, `/api/chat`, `lib/omega-agent/` |
| `.kiro/steering/chat-session-flow.md` | Chat routing, subject registry, XP, session persistence, `lib/chat/`, `lib/session/` |
| `.kiro/steering/sandbox-curriculum.md` | Sandbox activities, activity player, curriculum data, `lib/sandbox/`, `lib/curriculum/` |
| `.kiro/steering/progress-telemetry.md` | Mastery tracking, adaptive difficulty, interventions, analytics, `lib/progress/`, `lib/telemetry/` |
| `.kiro/steering/teacher-tools.md` | Teacher dashboard, scheme generator, FastAPI backend, `lib/teacher/`, `ai-agents/` |

---

## Quick facts

- **Frontend:** `studio/` — Next.js 16, deployed to sentastudio.vercel.app
- **AI backend:** `ai-agents/` — FastAPI on Render
- **Adaptive engine:** `lib/omega-agent/metta-core.ts` (TS port of `rust-core/src/agent_runtime.rs`)
- **lib/ is now modular** (restructured Sept 2026): import from `@/lib/<module>`, not from individual files
- **MeTTa prototype archived** to `studio/archive/metta-prototype/` — not in production
